DATA ATTRIBUTION (not covered by the MIT license above)

This repository downloads and samples the "Bitext - Customer Service Tagged Training Dataset for LLM-based
Virtual Assistants" by Bitext Innovations International, Inc.:
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/bitext/Bitext-customer-support-llm-chatbot-training-dataset
  file: Bitext_Sample_Customer_Support_Training_Dataset_27K_responses-v11.csv
  revision: 430d1a89bd93bd1fa23c16f29dd53e73f0087443
The dataset is licensed under the Community Data License Agreement - Sharing, Version 1.0
(CDLA-Sharing-1.0): https://cdla.dev/sharing-1-0/
results/sample_tickets.csv and the ticket text inside results/*.csv / raw.json are derived from that
dataset and are shared under CDLA-Sharing-1.0. Seeded rows (source=seeded) are synthetic and written for
this repo.

Models used at run time are not redistributed here: tev1:4b (Together AI, via Ollama) and
qwen3.5:4b-q4_K_M (Qwen, via Ollama). See each model's own license on ollama.com.
